Package: reach.rate
Title: Fit, Diagnose, and Apply Hydrometric Rating Curves
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jonathan", "Payne", , "jonathan.payne1988@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for fitting multi-limb power-law stage-discharge rating
    curves by nonlinear least squares, diagnosing fit quality, detecting and
    resolving discontinuities ("junction gaps") between independently-fitted
    limbs, converting a fitted rating into a discharge time series, and
    documenting rating amendments. Includes a segmented joint-model
    parameterisation after Hodson et al. (2024), bootstrap coefficient
    uncertainty, and versioned ratings for stations that have been re-rated
    over time. Fitted ratings are represented as 'S7' classes that carry
    their own gaugings, fitting bookkeeping, and provenance, so a rating is
    never separated from the data and assumptions that produced it.
